OL,3,GNEWSAHotel expansion set for approval
OL,4,Adespite horse fall fears
OL,5,
OL,6,FHowever, a report to Dumfries and
OL,7,FGalloway Council (DGC) said the closest
OL,8,Flodge would be about 30ft (9m) from the
OL,9,Fboundary and that was considered to be
OL,10,F"appropriate" separation from the
OL,11,Fgallops.
